            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_the_normal_distribution_m01_l01_drq03_p01_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Substitute values into the standardisation formula z = (x - mu) / sigma = (56 - 50) / 4."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_the_normal_distribution_m01_l01_drq03_p01_c02",
