              "text": "Obtain z = 1.5 and state that x = 56 lies above the mean (or 1.5 standard deviations above the mean)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_id": "9709_s1_t_the_normal_distribution_m01_l01_drq04",
      "parts": [
