              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Recognise symmetry about mu = 120 to state P(L < 116) = P(L > 124) = 0.0548 (or standardise 116 to get z = -1.6)."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_the_normal_distribution_m01_l01_cpq06_p02_c02",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Express the Standard category probability as 1 - 2 * 0.0548 (or Phi(1.6) - Phi(-1.6))."
